{"id":"ae206ab556213266","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence.md","title":"正确标准扩张中的 PA 可靠性与真理反射","display":"prop-soundness-truth-equivalence — 正确标准扩张中的 PA 可靠性与真理反射","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence","aliases":["91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence","91-prop-soundness-from-truth","91-prop-reflection-from-soundness"],"display":"prop-soundness-truth-equivalence — 正确标准扩张中的 PA 可靠性与真理反射","depends_on":["[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence</span><span>91-prop-soundness-from-truth</span><span>91-prop-reflection-from-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-soundness-truth-equivalence — 正确标准扩张中的 PA 可靠性与真理反射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce2e952933d30cc2\" href=\"?note=ce2e952933d30cc2\" title=\"91-df-expressive-completeness\">91-df-expressive-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_A=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)\">\\(\\mathfrak N_A=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_A)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(A=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为外部算术可靠性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为对象句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 使用标准证明编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}truth\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_A)\\Longrightarrow\n[\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_A\\models\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}truth\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_A)\\Longrightarrow\n[\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_A\\models\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原稿写 ℕ⊨T(n)，但 ℕ 没有解释新符号 T，是语义类型错误。现在把正确标准扩张列明；在标准结构中 Pr_PA 的外延恰是标准证明代码，逐句展开即得等价。\n它仍是外部语义等价，不声称 PA 自己证明全局反射，也不从任意名为 T 的新谓词推得正确性。</p>\n<p>来源：§8.6、Chapter 22；标准扩张可靠性条件的直接展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-expressive-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_A=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto A)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_A)","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}truth\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{ExpComp}(T,\\mathfrak N_A)\\Longrightarrow\n[\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_A\\models\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})].","display":true}],"bytes":1594,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-soundness-truth-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["acda8ebf92673c3d","ce2e952933d30cc2","16b107dfee99998b"]}